OL,3,AUS removes Syria from list of state
OL,4,Asponsors of terrorism
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Trump administration has embraced
OL,7,FSyria's new president, Ahmed al-Sharaa,
OL,8,Fa former militant who once had an
OL,9,FAmerican bounty on his head as the
OL,10,Fleader of an al-Qaeda off-shoot.
OL,12,FHis Islamist group, Hayat Tahrir
OL,13,Fal-Sham (HTS), was also removed from
OL,14,Fthe US list of global terrorist
OL,15,Forganisations.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
