OL,3,ANZ religious sect leader jailed over
OL,4,Adeath of Chinese follower
OL,5,
OL,6,FA New Zealand court has jailed a
OL,7,Freligious sect leader over the death of
OL,8,Fan elderly follower who had travelled
OL,9,Ffrom China to live with his family.
OL,11,FKaixiao Liu was found guilty of
OL,12,Fmanslaughter and kidnapping, and
OL,13,Fsentenced to more than 10 years in
OL,14,Fprison.
OL,16,FThe body of 70-year-old Shulai Wang had
OL,17,Fbeen found wrapped in rice bags near
OL,18,FAuckland's Gulf Harbour in March 2024,
OL,19,Fsparking a major homicide investigation
OL,20,Fwhich eventually led to Liu.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
